  "title": "Calabacitas con Elote (Mexican-Style Zucchini with Corn)",
  "description": "This delicious Mexican side dish is essentially corn, zucchini, onion, and garlic in buttermilk and topped with cheese. Makes a great side for Labor Day bbq celebrations.",
